{"unit_id":"sijidoubi__dsh-image-zoom#card-zh","repo":"sijidoubi/dsh-image-zoom","commit":"edff8a39fbc536e5a736bddc7bb28ba85edb79f3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-zoom 是一款面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 客户端的图片缩放插件。它通过客户端 DOM 点击委托，为聊天中带绝对 HTTP 或 HTTPS 地址的 Markdown 图片打开全屏灯箱。用户可以用滚轮或工具栏按钮缩放图片、放大后拖动平移、恢复适应视图，并通过 Esc、背景点击或关闭按钮退出，也可在新标签页打开原图。它适合需要查看聊天中细节较小的图片或图表的 DSH Web 用户；无需额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:143-155","src/client/index.ts:100-141"]}
{"unit_id":"sijidoubi__dsh-image-zoom#card-en","repo":"sijidoubi/dsh-image-zoom","commit":"edff8a39fbc536e5a736bddc7bb28ba85edb79f3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-image-zoom adds a click-to-zoom lightbox to DSH Web. Clicking an absolute HTTP(S) Markdown image opens a full-screen viewer. Zoom with the wheel or toolbar, drag to pan, reset the view, open the original in a new tab, or close with Escape or a click. It needs no API key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:100-155"]}
